## 4. Trust & Authenticity Optimization

Ensure testimonials include:

- Specific outcomes
- Real experiences
- Customer emotions
- Measurable improvements
- Credible details
- Natural language


Avoid:

- Fake claims
- Over exaggerated statements
- Generic praise
- Unsupported results
